{"seq":8,"slug":"hydrology-water-resources","title":"水文与水资源","stage":"DONE","category":"environmental-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 水文与水资源\n\n地球上约有 13.86 亿立方千米的水，其中能被人类直接取用的淡水不足百分之一，而这极少的一部分还在大气、地表与地下之间不停流转。理解这场永不停歇的循环，并在循环之上做出取舍与工程安排，正是水文学与水资源学要回答的问题。这个 hub 把「水如何运动」与「人如何用水」串成一条完整的认知链，从最朴素的水量守恒一直走到气候变化阴影下的水安全博弈。\n\n第一条主线是物理地基——水文循环。我们先建立水量平衡这个贯穿全 hub 的记账框架，再把循环拆成降水、蒸发、下渗三个分量逐一刻画它们的机理与测量，最后讲清楚水如何在流域里汇聚成径流。没有这一层，后面所有的评价、调度与预测都是无源之水。\n\n第二条主线把视线投向两大实际水体系统：地表水与地下水。河流与湖泊以明渠水力学和分层规律描述；地下水则由达西定律统领，含水层与井流构成另一套缓慢而隐蔽的运动逻辑。水不仅有量，还有质，于是水质与水生态成为连接自然系统与人类健康的桥梁。\n\n第三条主线是管理与工程：当我们摸清了水的来去与好坏，就要回答「有多少可用、如何分配、怎样防灾、靠什么工程保障供给」。水资源评价与配置（IWRM）给出制度框架，防洪与干旱应对极端，供水与水利工程把方案落到混凝土与管网上。\n\n第四条主线指向 2025–2026 年的前沿与挑战。气候变化按克劳修斯–克拉佩龙关系每升温 1°C 让大气持水能力增约 7%，正在加剧水循环的两端；联合国 2026 年世界水发展报告警告全球已进入「水破产」时代，约 40 亿人每年至少一个月遭遇严重缺水。与此同时，GRACE/SWOT 卫星、数字孪生与 AI 正把智慧水务从概念推向落地。\n\n四条主线层层递进：从「水如何循环」到「水在哪里、是好是坏」，再到「如何评价与工程化地用好它」，最终落脚于「在变暖的世界里如何守住水安全」。建议按章节顺序阅读，但每篇文档都尽量自洽，并通过交叉链接指向相关概念的主讲篇，方便你随时跳转、按需深入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrological-cycle","title":"水文循环","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"水文学导论：水量平衡与滞留时间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle/intro-and-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"precipitation-evaporation-infiltration","title":"降水、蒸发与下渗：水循环的三个垂向分量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle/precipitation-evaporation-infiltration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"runoff-watershed","title":"径流与流域：水的横向汇聚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle/runoff-watershed"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"surface-groundwater","title":"地表水与地下水","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rivers-lakes-hydrology","title":"河流与湖泊水文：地表水的运动与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/rivers-lakes-hydrology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"groundwater-aquifers","title":"地下水与含水层：达西定律与井流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/groundwater-aquifers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"water-quality-ecology","title":"水质与水生态：从溶解氧到生态流量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/water-quality-ecology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"water-resources-management","title":"水资源管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/water-resources-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"assessment-allocation-iwrm","title":"水资源评价与配置：从家底盘点到 IWRM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/water-resources-management/assessment-allocation-iwrm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"floods-droughts","title":"防洪与干旱：应对水的两个极端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/water-resources-management/floods-droughts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"water-supply-engineering","title":"供水与水利工程：把水送到需要的地方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/water-resources-management/water-supply-engineering"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers-challenges","title":"前沿与挑战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/frontiers-challenges","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-change-water","title":"气候变化与水：水循环的加速与极端化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/frontiers-challenges/climate-change-water"},{"seq":2,"slug":"water-scarcity-security","title":"水危机与水安全：从缺水到地缘博弈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/frontiers-challenges/water-scarcity-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-water-remote-sensing","title":"智慧水务与遥感：从太空称水到数字孪生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/frontiers-challenges/smart-water-remote-sensing"}]}]}